      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "1. Verify that the Zenith SmartHub is powered on and the indicator lights are illuminated.\n2. Check the physical Ethernet cable connection at both the Hub and the router, ensuring a secure fit.\n3. Power cycle your home router by unplugging it for 30 seconds and then plugging it back in.\n4. Confirm that the Wi-Fi network name (SSID) and password entered into the Hub settings are completely accurate.\n5. Temporarily disable any firewall or VPN software on your primary network device to rule out external interference.",
